---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How GET Labour Company Limited handles information submitted through this website — labour requests, employment applications and general enquiries."
>
  <PageHero
    variant="paper"
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy policy"
    lead="This policy explains what happens to information you submit through the GLCL website. It is a working draft written to match how this website actually operates."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose" data-reveal>
      <div class="form-alert form-alert--info is-visible" role="note">
        <span class="form-alert__icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
        <div>
          <p><strong>Draft status.</strong> This policy describes the actual data handling of
          this website. Before publication it should be reviewed and approved by company
          management, and by a qualified legal professional where required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        GET Labour Company Limited (“GLCL”, “we”) is a labour supply company based on Tema
        Meridian Road, around Tema Community 2, Tema, Ghana. Contact for privacy questions:
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or
        <a href={`tel:${site.phones[1].tel}`}>{site.phones[1].display}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only what you choose to submit through this website:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Labour request forms</strong> — contact name, company or organisation,
          telephone number, email address, the labour category requested, work details you
          describe, preferred contact method, and any optional information you add.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Employment application forms</strong> — name, telephone number, email
          address (optional), preferred work category, skills and experience, certifications,
          general location, personal statement, and your consent record.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>General enquiry forms</strong> — name, email address, telephone number
          (optional) and your message.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not ask for national identification documents, bank details, dates of birth or
        other sensitive personal information through this website, and we ask that you do not
        submit them.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>
        Submitted information is used for one purpose only: to respond to you and to assess
        and administer the request or application you made — for example, discussing a labour
        requirement with your company, or considering your suitability for work when a
        matching requirement arises.
      </p>

      <h2>4. How submissions are delivered</h2>
      <p>
        Forms on this website are delivered to GLCL by email using EmailJS
        (<a href="https://www.emailjs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">emailjs.com</a>),
        a third-party form-delivery service. When you submit a form, your entries are sent to
        GLCL’s email inbox through that service. If delivery fails, the website offers you a
        pre-filled email so you can send the same information yourself — your submission is
        never silently discarded or falsely confirmed.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website is hosted on GitHub Pages (<a href="https://pages.github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pages.github.com</a>).
        Standard server logs (including IP addresses) may be recorded by the host for security
        and operations purposes, under GitHub’s own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Who can see your information</h2>
      <p>
        Your submission is visible to GLCL staff who handle enquiries, labour requests and
        employment applications. We do not sell personal information and we do not share it
        for marketing. We do not publish applicant details on this website.
      </p>

      <h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Labour requests are kept as long as needed to handle the enquiry and any resulting
        arrangement, and for a reasonable period afterwards for record-keeping. Application
        details are kept while they remain relevant to potential placements. If you want your
        details removed, email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your name and the phone number
        you used, and we will delete them from our records.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>
        Submissions travel over encrypted HTTPS connections and arrive in GLCL’s email inbox.
        Access is limited to staff who need it for their work. No internet system is
        completely secure, so please avoid submitting sensitive personal information through
        website forms in the first place.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct
        it, or ask us to delete it, by contacting the details above. We will respond to
        reasonable requests as quickly as practical.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated when the website or its data handling changes. The latest
        version is always published on this page.
      </p>

      <p class="field-hint" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
        Last updated: October 2026 — drafted to match the live behaviour of this website
        (form delivery via EmailJS, hosting on GitHub Pages).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
